!
! Startup script fields:
! 1. Object Type      -- CFE_APP for an Application, or CFE_LIB for a library.
! 2. Path/Filename    -- Not used: all applications are linked into the image.
! 3. Entry Point      -- The "main" function of the application.
! 4. CFE Name         -- The cFE name of the application or library. It must
!                        match the name in cpu1_STATIC_SYMLIST in targets.cmake.
! 5. Priority         -- 0 is the most urgent. Not used for a library.
! 6. Stack Size       -- In bytes. Not used for a library.
! 7. Load Address     -- Not implemented; keep it at 0x0.
! 8. Exception Action -- 0 restarts the application; non-zero resets the cFE.
